Package: cipher
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libssl3
Recommends: libcuda1 | libcuda-12-1 | libcuda-12-2 | libcuda-13-0
Maintainer: CIPHER <support@cipher.example>
Description: GPU driver-level neural execution layer
 CIPHER is an LD_PRELOAD-based GPU efficiency middleware. Intercepts CUDA API
 calls and applies driver-level optimizations: FP8 weight quantization, RMSNorm
 fusion, multi-tenant fairness scheduling, NCCL algorithm tuning, L2 cache
 persistence, and per-tenant policy enforcement.
 .
 Customer applications run unchanged. Operator wraps invocations with
 /opt/cipher/bin/cipher_run.sh which sets LD_PRELOAD and runtime env.
